# L §5.14 (tally 2.1.2, issue #43): the twin of L5_14_leg_currencies_money. A leg of unit kind `currencies` takes
# money in a declared currency, and nothing else: an int amount is still refused at load (LOAD-UNIT).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind curs: event certain
  leg cash: currencies
input flag_amt: int
input day: date
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move in_cur: curs
  on day
  at day
  leg cash from world to konto amount flag_amt

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31), in_cur.cash.amount

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  flag_amt = 25
  day = 2026-02-01
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT the amount of leg cash of in_cur is int, not a unit of currencies (m.tally:19)
